  "steps": [
    "Melt the butter in a large Dutch oven over medium heat. Add the onion, carrots and celery and saute for 5 minutes.",
    "Add the garlic and saute for 5 more minutes.",
    "Add the vegetable broth and bring to a boil, stirring occasionally.",
    "Reduce the heat to low and simmer for 10 minutes, stirring occasionally.",
    "Stir in the pumpkin and cinnamon and simmer for 15 minutes.",
    "Blend the soup in batches in a blender or food processor until smooth, then return it to the pot.",
    "With the heat on low, stir in the evaporated milk, half and half, goat cheese and brown sugar until the cheese is blended, the sugar has melted and the soup is hot.",
    "Season with salt and pepper, ladle into bowls and garnish with extra goat cheese."
  ],
